# 🎨 Level 2 Documentation Glassmorphism Standardization Plan

**Version:** 3.0.0 | **Status:** 🟡 ACTIVE  
**Author:** Asif Hussain | **Created:** December 31, 2025  
**Updated:** January 1, 2026  
**Copyright © 2025 Asif Hussain. All rights reserved.**

---

## 📋 Executive Summary

This plan standardizes the **entire CORTEX documentation hierarchy** across **all 9 home page tiles** to follow the **Glassmorphism Design Standard v3.2.0**, with a **strict 2-level maximum depth** for all feature areas. This applies universally to:

1. 🧠 **Architecture** (4-Tier Brain System)
2. 🛡️ **Security** (Threat Modeling & Compliance)
3. 🎯 **Orchestrators** (6 Autonomous Workflows)
4. 💰 **Token Optimization** (97% Input Reduction)
5. 🔧 **Sharpen The Saw** (77 Flaws Transformed)
6. 📚 **CORTEX Best Practices** (35 Guidelines)
7. 🛠️ **Toolkit Manager** (Tool Orchestration Layer)
8. 🔍 **CORTEX LENS** (AST Analysis & Reverse Engineering)
9. 🚀 **Get Started** (5-Minute Setup)

---

## 🏗️ View Hierarchy Architecture

### ⛔ CRITICAL RULE: Maximum 2 Levels Only
```
Level 0 → Level 1 → Level 2 (MAX)
   ↓         ↓         ↓
 Home    Overview   Detail
```

**NO Level 3+ views permitted.** All high-value showcasing, diagrams (D3.js, Mermaid), and detailed content MUST fit within Level 2. Use expandable sections, tabs, or modals for additional depth.

---

## 🎬 Animation Tier System (v3.0.0)

### ⛔ CRITICAL: Subtle Animations by Default

**User Directive:** "I want glassmorphism to have subtle animation across all 9 tiles (Architecture, Security, Orchestrators, Token Optimization, Sharpen The Saw, CORTEX Best Practices, Toolkit Manager, CORTEX LENS, Get Started) with NO dramatic effects like those used on skull protector and knowledge graph."

### Animation Tiers

| Tier | Name | Use Case | Examples |
|------|------|----------|----------|
| **T1** | **Subtle** (DEFAULT) | ALL Level 1 & Level 2 pages for all 9 tiles | Hover opacity, light transforms, simple transitions |
| **T2** | **Accent** | Interactive elements requiring user feedback | Button press, form focus, selection highlight |
| **T3** | **Dramatic** | ONLY Home page (Level 0) hero section | borderGlowSweep, blobMorph, particle effects |

**Scope:** This standard applies universally to ALL 9 home page tiles and their Level 2 sub-pages.

### Tier 1: Subtle Animations (DEFAULT FOR ALL PAGES)

```css
/* ✅ APPROVED - Subtle hover effects */
.glass-card {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}

.glass-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    opacity: 0.95;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

/* ✅ APPROVED - Simple focus states */
.interactive-element:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-primary);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* ✅ APPROVED - Gentle transitions */
.nav-link {
    transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
}
```

**Subtle Animation Properties (T1):**
- `transition-duration: 0.2s - 0.3s` (fast, responsive)
- `transform: translateY(-2px to -4px)` (minimal lift)
- `opacity: 0.9 - 1.0` (slight dimming on hover)
- No infinite animations
- No keyframe animations on cards
- No glow pulses or sweeps
- No filter effects

**⛔ Applies to ALL 9 feature tile hierarchies:**
1. 🧠 Architecture → SKULL Protection, Knowledge Graph, 4-Tier Brain, Context Analysis
2. 🛡️ Security → Threat Modeling, Compliance, Security Audits
3. 🎯 Orchestrators → TDD, Planning, Debug, ADO, Cleanup, Refinement (+ 10 more)
4. 💰 Token Optimization → Token Analysis, Reduction Strategies, Cost Savings
5. 🔧 Sharpen The Saw → Code Quality, SOLID, Testing, Performance, Security, Docs
6. 📚 CORTEX Best Practices → 35 Implementation Guidelines
7. 🛠️ Toolkit Manager → Tool Discovery, Orchestration, Integration
8. 🔍 CORTEX LENS → AST Analysis, Reverse Engineering, Code Intelligence
9. 🚀 Get Started → Setup, Configuration, First Steps

### Tier 2: Accent Animations (Interactive Feedback)

```css
/* ✅ APPROVED - Button feedback */
.btn-glass:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
    transition: transform 0.1s ease;
}

/* ✅ APPROVED - Form focus */
input:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.2);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

/* ✅ APPROVED - Selection indicator */
.tab-active {
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-primary);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
}
```

### Tier 3: Dramatic Animations (RESTRICTED)

**⛔ ONLY ALLOWED ON:**
- `docs/index.html` (Home page hero)
- Landing page hero sections
- Special showcase pages (explicitly marked)

**❌ FORBIDDEN ON:**
- ALL Level 1 pages (9 feature tiles)
- ALL Level 2 detail pages for any tile
- Architecture components (SKULL, Knowledge Graph, Brain Tiers)
- Orchestrator detail pages
- STS category pages
- Best practices guidelines
- Toolkit tool pages
- LENS analysis pages
- Setup instruction pages

```css
/* ❌ DEPRECATED for ALL Level 1/2 pages across all 9 tiles */
@keyframes borderGlowSweep { /* HERO ONLY */ }
@keyframes blobMorph { /* HERO ONLY */ }
@keyframes lightLeakPrimary { /* HERO ONLY */ }
@keyframes glowPulse { /* HERO ONLY */ }
```

### Pages Requiring Animation Simplification

| Tile | Page | Current | Target | Action |
|------|------|---------|--------|--------|
| Architecture | `skull-protection.html` | T3 (borderGlowSweep, pulse) | T1 (subtle hover) | 🔴 SIMPLIFY |
| Architecture | `knowledge-graph.html` | T3 (glow filters, sweeps) | T1 (subtle hover) | 🔴 SIMPLIFY |
| Architecture | `index.html` | T1 | T1 | ✅ OK |
| Orchestrators | `index.html` | T1 | T1 | ✅ OK |
| All Others | All Level 1/2 pages | Must be T1 | T1 | 🟡 VERIFY |

